      ":question/problem": "Express $\\cos\\left(\\theta+\\pi\\right)$ in terms of $\\sin \\theta$ or $\\cos \\theta$.\n\nUse the formula\n\n$$\n\\cos(u+v)=\\cos u\\cos v-\\sin u\\sin v\n$$\n\nand the exact values $\\cos(\\pi)=-1$ and $\\sin(\\pi)=0$.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use the sum formula:\n\n$$\n\\cos(u+v)=\\cos u\\cos v-\\sin u\\sin v\n$$\n\nWith $u=\\theta$ and $v=\\pi$, the exact values are $\\cos(\\pi)=-1$ and $\\sin(\\pi)=0$. Substitute and collect the terms in the requested order:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\cos\\left(\\theta+\\pi\\right)&=\\cos \\theta\\cos\\left(\\pi\\right)-\\sin \\theta\\sin\\left(\\pi\\right)\\\\\n&=\\cos \\theta\\cdot\\left(-1\\right)-\\sin \\theta\\cdot\\left(0\\right)\\\\\n&=-\\cos \\theta.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
